abstract: >-
  Agent Retrieval Bench evaluates repository context retrieval for coding
  agents across code2test, comment2context, trace2code, edit2ripple, and
  selective no-gold retrieval. It contains 427 workflow-derived samples
  evaluated against frozen base-commit corpora.
